{"author":321,"label":"Ashish Vidyarthi","poems":[{"id":392,"source_language":"hi","variants":{"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"जिंदगी जिंदादिली का नाम है","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["जिंदगी जिंदादिली का नाम है","खुलकर कभी मुस्कुरा भी लो,","गम तो हजारों हैं जीवन में","अपनी मुस्कुराहट में इसे छुपा भी लो ।"],["मुस्कुराते चेहरों की अपनी","एक अलग परिभाषा होती है","यह गम के कीचड़ में भी","खुशी के फूल खिला देती है ।"],["मुस्कुराते चेहरे सामने वालों की","दिलों में समा जाता है","ना बनने वाले कामों को भी","चुटकी में बना जाता है ।"],["छोटी सी मुस्कुराहट","बड़ी अनमोल होती है","सफलता दिलाने में इसकी","अहम रोल होती है।"],["आपकी मुस्कान आपके","अंतर्मन को दर्शाता है","सामने वालों पर अमिट","छाप छोड़ जाता है ।"],["इसलिए मुस्कुराने में","कोई कंजूसी ना करो","भगवान का दिया मुफ्त उपहार है ,","जी भरकर इसका प्रयोग करो ।"],["इसलिए कहता हूं","जिंदगी जिंदादिली का नाम है","खुलकर कभी मुस्कुरा भी लो","गम तो हजारों हैं जीवन में","अपने मुस्कुराहट में से छिपा भी लो ।"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"en":{"label":"English","title":"Life Means Living with Spirit","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["Life means living with spirit;","sometimes smile freely too.","There are a thousand sorrows in life;","hide them in your smile too."],["Smiling faces have","a definition of their own:","even in sorrow's mud,","they make flowers of joy bloom."],["A smiling face enters","the hearts of those before it;","even tasks that would not come right","it sets right in a snap."],["A little smile","is very precious.","In bringing success,","it plays an important role."],["Your smile reveals","your inner self;","upon those before you, an indelible","impression it leaves."],["So, in smiling,","do not be miserly.","It is a free gift from God;","use it to your heart's content."],["That is why I say:","life means living with spirit;","sometimes smile freely too.","There are a thousand sorrows in life;","hide them in your smile too."]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"or":{"label":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","title":"ଜୀବନ ମାନେ ପ୍